<title>UK: Asfinag sets $250 million 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>Asfinag sets $250 million 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUTOBAHNEN-UND SCHNELLSTRASSEN FINANZIERUNGS AG</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.50 PCT  MATURITY    24.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.27    PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.67     SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY     *AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD	 MGT/UND    0.275</p>
<p> SELL CONC  1.60	*GUARANTOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
